label Has_met_overworker
join bartender left
bartender: Did you now? And how did you find him?
main_player: He seems pretty obsessed with his work.
bartender: Hah! That's Richard for you. The man could probably work himself into an early grave.
main_player: Doesn't anyone try to help him?
bartender: Oh, plenty have tried. Whether they actually helped is another question.”
main_player: What do you mean?
bartender: Well, everyone has their own way of dealing with things, friend. You can't simply expect people to change because you tell them to.
main_player: So what am I supposed to do?
bartender: That's for you to figure out. I'm merely the bartender, after all.
This is the end of the demo. Feel free to look around, or press ESC and then the Quit button to exit the game. Thanks for testing.
set {bartender.DemoDone} = true
[end_timeline]
label Introduction_bartender
set {bartender.HasMetBartender} = true
set {bartender.RatFightCompleted} = false
join bartender left
bartender: This is Lethe's End, friend. I'm the owner, and bartender, of this inn. And you are a resident, staying here for an indefinite amount of time.
leave bartender [animation="Instant Out"]
main_player: Where am I?
join bartender left [animation="Instant In"]
bartender: Somewhere you might not remember for a while.
leave bartender [animation="Instant Out"]
main_player: I don't remember anything.
join bartender left [animation="Instant In"]
bartender: Perhaps that's for the best, friend. Sometimes a clean slate is exactly what a person needs.
leave bartender [animation="Instant Out"]
main_player: How do I get out?
join bartender left [animation="Instant In"]
bartender: Oh, eager to leave already? Let's not get ahead of ourselves. First, you'll need to get familiar with the place.
leave bartender [animation="Instant Out"]
[i]A loud squeaking noise comes from nearby.[/i]
join rat left [animation="Instant In"]
rat: AAAAAGH!
leave rat [animation="Instant Out"]
main_player: What the hell was that?!
join bartender left [animation="Instant In"]
bartender: Oh! A little visitor! How rude of him not to introduce himself.
leave bartender [animation="Instant Out"]
[i]The rat attacks the player.[/i]
[end_timeline]
label introduction_after_rat_defeated
bartender: Wonderful! Pest control and entertainment, all in one. You're quite useful already!
main_player: So, what now?
bartender: Well, if you can handle that little fellow, I'm sure you can manage a visit to room 101. Perhaps Richard has a little more information for you.
main_player: Who is Richard?
bartender: Ahh, resident 101. 'The Overworker' I call him. You'll understand why soon enough.
[end_timeline]
label idle_demo_active
- About Richard... | [if {bartender.DemoDone}  ==  false]
	join bartender left
	bartender: Have you talked to him?
	leave bartender
	join main_player center
	if {overworker.HasMetOverworker} == false:
		main_player: No[pause=0.25].[pause=0.25].[pause=0.25].
		leave main_player
		join bartender left
		bartender: Well go do that
	else:
		join main_player center
		main_player: I have
		leave main_player
		jump Has_met_overworker
- Do you know where I can get the backstage key? | [if !{singer.HAS_STAGE_KEY} && {singer.HAS_TALKED_TO} == true]
	join bartender left
	bartender: Maybe
	leave bartender
	join main_player center
	main_player: Why maybe?
	leave main_player
	join bartender left
	bartender: Well I lost it when I went upstairs. So it has to be up there somewhere. I think.
	leave bartender
	join main_player center
	main_player: I'll go look there then.
[end_timeline]
label idle_demo_done
join bartender left
bartender: <Go explore/See if you can do something with your time>
[end_timeline]